  "value": "vote map per (user, article); an array of article ids kept sorted by (-score, id) and updated by binary-search removal and insertion; per-user insertion-ordered maps of flipped articles. Complexity target: O(log A + A) per vote (array shift), O(k) per ranking query, O(flipped articles of the user) per flip query.",
